## LWJGL's native-library extraction cache, created at runtime when running the client
## (wherever the working directory happened to be when it was run):
.lwjgl/

## Runtime-generated local data (design.md 3.6/3.7) - a real player account store or a
## saved login (including a plaintext password, see 3.7) could land in any directory a
## server/client happens to be launched from, not just server/target or lwjgl3/target:
data/accounts.json
connection-config.json
keybindings.json

## Old Gradle setup, kept around only until the Maven migration is confirmed working:
/_gradle-legacy-backup/
